        <detaileddescription>
<para>Known port for the shared editor server. Every in-editor launcher (PIE, the chat panel, the model manager panel) probes this port before spawning and reuses whatever it finds there, so one warm server survives across PIE sessions and multiple open tool windows instead of each spawning its own. Packaged/player builds ignore this and always pick a free ephemeral port. </para>
